WEBVTT

00:00.990 --> 00:05.230
<i>With Barbador Magic Academy's 
class competition coming up,</i>

00:05.850 --> 00:08.690
<i>Class F was burning with the 
desire to defeat Class S,</i>

00:08.690 --> 00:11.910
<i>so they asked Seiichi to give 
them intensive training.</i>

00:12.330 --> 00:15.280
<i>Then the day of the 
competition finally arrived!</i>

00:16.280 --> 00:19.500
<i>But it was interrupted by the appearance 
of the Great Devil Order's apostles,</i>

00:19.500 --> 00:21.610
<i>Demioros and Angrea!</i>

00:22.750 --> 00:26.000
<i>Class F teamed up with 
their nemesis, Theobald,</i>

00:26.000 --> 00:29.130
<i>to defend the school and face Angrea!</i>

00:30.090 --> 00:33.810
<i>However, their efforts were futile 
against her terrifying might,</i>

00:33.810 --> 00:35.700
<i>and they were defeated.</i>

00:35.700 --> 00:38.360
<i>The one who then stood 
up to defend them was...</i>

00:38.360 --> 00:42.640
I won't let you lay a hand 
on my students any longer!

00:43.150 --> 00:44.970
<i>It's Beatrice versus Angrea.</i>

00:44.970 --> 00:48.150
<i>Who will come out on top in their fight?</i>

00:53.860 --> 00:57.780
<b>The Fruit of Evolution 2:</b>

00:53.860 --> 00:57.780
<b>The Fruit of Evolution 2:</b>

00:54.940 --> 00:57.780
<b>Before I Knew It, My Life Had It Made</b>

00:54.940 --> 00:57.780
<b>Before I Knew It, My Life Had It Made</b>

00:54.940 --> 00:57.780
<b>Before I Knew It, My Life Had It Made</b>

02:20.160 --> 02:25.080
<b>Battle for Barbador Magic Academy</b>

02:46.950 --> 02:49.890
Beatrice-sensei...

02:50.600 --> 02:52.460
You won't let me?

02:52.460 --> 02:56.820
I'd love to see if a hag like you 
can even do anything about it!

02:57.160 --> 02:58.360
Hag?

02:59.070 --> 03:01.440
I'm sorry, Beatrice-kun!

03:01.440 --> 03:04.290
I want to come help you, 
but these bonds are so tight!

03:04.290 --> 03:07.200
I'm definitely not just enjoying this!

03:10.780 --> 03:12.930
I will protect our students!

03:17.290 --> 03:18.610
Oh?

03:22.550 --> 03:27.350
Hmm? Protect your students?

03:27.970 --> 03:31.550
Well, can you still say that after this?

03:45.890 --> 03:47.240
Agnos-kun!

03:47.240 --> 03:48.410
That's...

04:00.140 --> 04:02.020
What will you do now?

04:08.470 --> 04:10.100
If only...

04:11.150 --> 04:14.770
...Seiichi-sensei were here...

04:16.910 --> 04:19.500
Seiichi, you still in there?

04:19.500 --> 04:21.450
Are you okay?

04:21.450 --> 04:23.950
I'm not!

04:23.950 --> 04:24.900
Go!

04:24.900 --> 04:26.530
Masked Pompadour!

04:28.450 --> 04:30.200
Stop this, Agnos-kun!

04:30.640 --> 04:32.500
Return to your senses!

04:33.080 --> 04:34.620
Stop it, Agnos!

04:37.510 --> 04:39.250
It's no use, idiot!

04:39.250 --> 04:42.210
He'll only listen to what I tell him now.

04:44.130 --> 04:48.800
Hey, Pompadour, tell her how you truly feel!

04:52.270 --> 04:56.200
I'm able to use magic 
thanks to Seiichi-sensei.

04:56.200 --> 04:57.860
Not thanks to you.

04:57.860 --> 04:59.510
Not thanks to you.

04:59.510 --> 05:01.110
Not thanks to you.

05:01.110 --> 05:02.710
Not thanks to you.

05:02.710 --> 05:04.310
Not thanks to you.

05:13.540 --> 05:16.360
That expression is the best!

05:16.360 --> 05:18.230
I love it!

05:22.550 --> 05:24.570
Sensei, please don't believe him!

05:24.570 --> 05:26.280
He's just being forced to say that!

05:26.280 --> 05:27.350
That's right!

05:27.350 --> 05:30.550
He's grateful to you, just like all of us are!

05:34.200 --> 05:36.760
We'll stop Agnos by force!

05:37.940 --> 05:39.320
It's fine!

05:40.020 --> 05:41.860
This is my punishment.

05:41.860 --> 05:45.630
My punishment for not being 
able to bring out your talents.

05:47.890 --> 05:49.200
Sensei!

05:49.200 --> 05:51.780
Finish her off, Pompadour!

05:56.690 --> 05:59.250
But even so...

06:03.500 --> 06:05.640
I still want to be your teacher!

06:09.840 --> 06:11.560
Agnos Passion!

06:11.560 --> 06:13.010
Get a hold of yourself!

06:14.840 --> 06:16.550
Wh-What are you doing?!

06:16.550 --> 06:20.050
Go on! Rip that woman apart!

06:21.640 --> 06:22.730
I get it!

06:23.020 --> 06:23.850
Agnos-kun!

06:23.850 --> 06:25.940
<i>Because he kept getting 
chastised day in and day out...</i>

06:25.940 --> 06:26.760
Agnos-kun!

06:26.760 --> 06:29.930
<i>His body—no, his very soul remembers it!</i>

06:29.930 --> 06:32.780
<i>Sensei's strict, yet warm affection!</i>

06:35.700 --> 06:39.620
You listen to what I tell you!

06:43.780 --> 06:44.760
Agnos!

06:45.580 --> 06:46.970
What?!

06:49.630 --> 06:53.050
Using others to commit evil deeds...

06:53.820 --> 06:58.480
It looks like you need some 
especially strict discipline.

06:58.480 --> 07:03.270
Go ahead and try, you damn teacher!

07:07.170 --> 07:08.030
Wha—

07:09.400 --> 07:11.800
You're next!

07:31.370 --> 07:33.390
That concludes the lesson.

07:33.640 --> 07:35.110
Any questions?

07:37.340 --> 07:40.090
Now, that's it for today's class.

07:48.830 --> 07:49.660
Huh?

07:50.050 --> 07:51.230
What was I...

07:51.540 --> 07:52.730
Agnos-kun.

07:53.450 --> 07:55.310
Boss Lady Beatrice...

07:56.470 --> 07:59.290
Boss Lady, I... I...

07:59.580 --> 08:01.370
I don't really get what happened,

08:01.370 --> 08:04.350
but I said something awful to you, didn't I?!

08:04.350 --> 08:06.310
That wasn't true!

08:06.960 --> 08:09.450
I don't remember what I did at all,

08:09.450 --> 08:11.210
but I know I need to apologize,

08:11.210 --> 08:12.810
to tell you it wasn't true!

08:12.810 --> 08:14.590
I may be an idiot,

08:14.590 --> 08:17.310
but I wouldn't do anything to hurt you!

08:17.720 --> 08:20.290
Anyway, I'm sorry!

08:22.410 --> 08:23.170
Huh?

08:24.370 --> 08:27.400
You shouldn't be falling asleep during class.

08:27.860 --> 08:29.810
Boss Lady!

08:29.810 --> 08:31.050
Thank you, Sensei.

08:31.050 --> 08:33.530
I had no idea you were that strong.

08:33.530 --> 08:36.450
Huh? What do you mean she's strong?

08:36.450 --> 08:38.580
Don't you remember?

08:38.580 --> 08:40.490
Well, I guess an idiot wouldn't.

08:40.490 --> 08:41.420
What?!

08:41.420 --> 08:43.610
I won't let anyone say that, even you!

08:44.130 --> 08:47.480
You actually fought against her, you know.

08:47.480 --> 08:50.170
Huh?! I don't remember that at all!

08:51.800 --> 08:53.560
Don't laugh!

08:53.560 --> 08:57.020
Have you forgotten? I'm still h—

08:54.290 --> 08:56.710
What's with you guys?!

08:57.020 --> 08:59.290
Anyway, let's all go grab something to eat!

08:59.290 --> 09:02.340
Agnos-kun, you need to go 
to the nurse's office first.

09:02.340 --> 09:03.630
Whoops.

09:12.300 --> 09:13.610
Principal!

09:13.610 --> 09:17.550
Have you forgotten me?!

09:19.830 --> 09:24.050
Honestly... I wish you'd save the 
celebration until after you've defeated me,

09:24.050 --> 09:28.380
the Great Devil Order apostle, 
Demioros the Deliverance.

09:28.380 --> 09:30.010
Now that you mention it...

09:30.010 --> 09:31.350
There was that other guy.

09:31.350 --> 09:32.570
I forgot about him.

09:32.570 --> 09:33.800
Also...

09:34.170 --> 09:37.930
I absolutely loathe waiters who 
don't respond when they're summoned,

09:39.850 --> 09:42.930
and idiots who can't read the room!

09:42.930 --> 09:45.180
Die, die, die, die!

09:54.360 --> 09:55.740
Good grief.

09:56.180 --> 10:00.030
Now, Sensei, if you would please continue...

10:00.430 --> 10:03.270
with your lovely special lesson.

10:13.510 --> 10:15.620
D-Demioros...

10:16.210 --> 10:18.970
Oh, my. You're still alive?

10:19.230 --> 10:26.230
P-Please... lend me... 
just a bit of your power...

10:27.620 --> 10:28.870
My power?

10:30.150 --> 10:34.690
If you do... then I can keep fighting...

10:36.650 --> 10:39.270
Wh-What's so funny?

10:41.460 --> 10:43.800
I'm already finished with you.

10:45.570 --> 10:48.570
You would forsake me, a fellow apostle?

10:48.570 --> 10:51.080
The Great Devil won't allow it!

10:51.550 --> 10:54.490
You seem to be misunderstanding something.

10:54.490 --> 10:57.030
You're no apostle.

10:57.030 --> 10:58.910
What do you mean?

11:00.180 --> 11:04.360
An apostle is one who has received 
a portion of the Great Devil's power

11:04.360 --> 11:06.580
and can use it.

11:06.580 --> 11:10.130
A crest appears on their body as proof of that.

11:10.130 --> 11:11.350
Like this one.

11:11.990 --> 11:14.810
N-No...

11:15.650 --> 11:19.600
Well? Do you have a crest anywhere on you?

11:19.600 --> 11:22.750
Your only value lies in your 
intellect and your magical might.

11:22.750 --> 11:26.450
But now you've lost even that value.

11:30.250 --> 11:33.370
That look on your face is perfect!

11:33.370 --> 11:36.260
That despair is just we want!

11:36.260 --> 11:38.310
For the sake of the Great Devil!

11:47.350 --> 11:51.770
Now, shall we get started 
with the rest of the lesson?

11:53.060 --> 11:56.660
You need especially strict 
discipline, don't you?

12:04.470 --> 12:06.070
He's strong!

12:08.870 --> 12:12.410
Come on, give me some of 
that discipline, please!

12:14.880 --> 12:16.540
Beatrice-sensei!

12:18.960 --> 12:20.090
Boss Lady!

12:20.090 --> 12:21.010
Sensei!

12:21.010 --> 12:21.970
Stay back!

12:23.660 --> 12:27.450
You mustn't come closer!

12:34.540 --> 12:35.740
I'm glad.

12:36.120 --> 12:39.000
It would be boring if this were the end.

12:52.140 --> 12:54.100
Sensei's going all-out.

12:54.100 --> 12:55.920
That's totally wicked!

12:55.920 --> 12:57.330
Oh?

12:58.060 --> 13:01.300
Now this... is your dead end!

13:16.150 --> 13:18.100
N-No way...

13:18.100 --> 13:21.480
I really liked this one, too.

13:22.030 --> 13:24.300
Are you ready to compensate me for it...

13:24.300 --> 13:26.280
with your life?!

13:30.870 --> 13:33.830
Come on, come on, come on!

13:37.210 --> 13:38.210
Baird!

13:59.890 --> 14:00.900
Everyone!

14:09.340 --> 14:11.070
That's great.

14:11.340 --> 14:17.710
The despair you'll feel after losing your 
beloved students should be tremendous.

14:18.190 --> 14:20.670
Please tell me, Sensei.

14:20.670 --> 14:25.320
What kind of expression do humans 
make when struck with despair?

14:28.490 --> 14:29.890
Oh?

14:29.890 --> 14:34.440
You'll protect your students
even at the cost of your own life?

14:35.580 --> 14:37.980
How wonderful, Sensei!

14:37.980 --> 14:40.650
You're worthy of respect.

14:40.650 --> 14:42.130
But no.

14:42.130 --> 14:44.520
No! No! That's not it!

14:44.520 --> 14:49.030
You must despair as your students 
are killed before your eyes.

14:49.030 --> 14:51.930
Do you understand now?

14:52.330 --> 14:54.530
So move already.

14:55.170 --> 14:56.970
I am an educator.

14:57.450 --> 15:00.580
I'm one of those entrusted to believe 
in the potential of their students,

15:00.580 --> 15:02.960
help it grow, and watch over them.

15:02.960 --> 15:05.340
I will never stand down!

15:07.420 --> 15:09.550
What are you saying, Boss Lady?!

15:09.550 --> 15:11.210
Why would you go so far?!

15:11.210 --> 15:11.970
Sensei!

15:13.090 --> 15:16.460
The teacher they admire will 
be killed before their eyes.

15:16.460 --> 15:22.600
I'm sure the Great Devil would be 
quite delighted with that despair, too.

15:28.690 --> 15:30.670
It's over now!

15:31.770 --> 15:36.350
Thank you for your instruction!

15:39.820 --> 15:40.790
Everyone...

15:40.790 --> 15:43.160
Stop!

15:52.770 --> 15:54.150
Seiichi-sensei!

15:54.150 --> 15:55.470
Boss Man!

15:55.690 --> 15:57.390
Sei-chan!

15:58.680 --> 16:00.550
Seiichi-sensei?

16:01.160 --> 16:03.990
What is this? What's going on?

16:04.420 --> 16:06.070
You there...

16:07.360 --> 16:10.300
Would you release my hand?

16:11.240 --> 16:12.220
What?!

16:13.420 --> 16:15.860
Are you all right, Beatrice-sensei?

16:15.860 --> 16:18.080
S-Seiichi-sensei...

16:19.190 --> 16:22.460
Saria, Oliga-chan, take care of everyone.

16:22.830 --> 16:24.390
Leave them to us, Onii-chan!

16:24.390 --> 16:25.610
But what about you?

16:35.340 --> 16:36.660
<i>He's...</i>

16:37.630 --> 16:40.910
Are you the one who did all this?

16:42.360 --> 16:45.310
Did you... do this?

16:54.190 --> 16:55.490
Answer me.

16:56.260 --> 17:00.530
Are you the one who hurt all of them?!

17:16.340 --> 17:19.210
You're finished!

17:19.760 --> 17:23.100
Die!

17:23.100 --> 17:32.360
Die, die, die, die, die, die, die!

17:44.540 --> 17:46.960
A-Amazing...

17:53.890 --> 17:56.340
Master! You're too awesome!

17:56.340 --> 17:58.550
He's unbelievable.

17:58.850 --> 18:00.400
Onii-chan!

18:00.400 --> 18:02.430
You did it, Seiichi!

18:02.430 --> 18:04.110
I'm sorry, everyone.

18:04.110 --> 18:06.060
This happened because I was late.

18:06.060 --> 18:07.490
Boss Man, you're awesome!

18:07.490 --> 18:09.470
You really are super strong!

18:09.470 --> 18:13.410
None of this would have happened 
if you were here from the start!

18:12.980 --> 18:16.740
<b>Almighty</b>

18:13.410 --> 18:16.740
Sensei, where were you all this time?

18:17.620 --> 18:20.910
I'm sorry. I was fighting a different enemy.

18:21.650 --> 18:23.820
That's our Boss Man!

18:23.820 --> 18:27.250
Both you and Boss Lady are the best teachers!

18:27.930 --> 18:29.580
<i>I'll get stronger, too.</i>

18:30.140 --> 18:31.610
<i>Like both of them.</i>

18:31.920 --> 18:34.590
Wow, Seiichi!

18:34.860 --> 18:37.190
You were incredible!

18:46.200 --> 18:47.540
Brud.

18:48.420 --> 18:51.990
Will you laugh at your 
brother's pathetic defeat?

18:51.990 --> 18:53.160
No.

18:53.160 --> 18:55.670
We still have much to learn.

18:55.670 --> 18:57.000
That's all.

18:58.130 --> 19:01.200
Let's get stronger, too, Brother.

19:02.490 --> 19:03.410
Hmph.

19:21.720 --> 19:26.640
I'm grateful that you all have 
made the long journey to be here.

19:28.280 --> 19:32.400
It's been a real long time since the 
four of us got together, hasn't it?

19:33.300 --> 19:36.100
So? What's this about?

19:37.960 --> 19:43.110
The two sent to Barbador, 
Angrea and Demioros, have been defeated.

19:43.940 --> 19:44.970
Oh?

19:45.770 --> 19:48.200
Our enemy's not half bad!

19:48.200 --> 19:53.000
I've summoned you all here today 
so we can make our next move.

19:53.000 --> 19:55.370
That's all well and good,

19:55.370 --> 19:57.510
but why are you giving the orders?

19:58.130 --> 20:01.480
No, I would never dare give orders.

20:01.980 --> 20:06.680
I was simply hoping to borrow your aid 
for the revival of the Great Devil.

20:06.680 --> 20:08.630
Sure!

20:08.630 --> 20:13.800
Though I never had much hope for 
those two from the beginning.

20:14.920 --> 20:16.810
I'll strike first!

20:16.810 --> 20:19.000
Go right ahead.

20:19.660 --> 20:21.640
If you would, please.

22:03.420 --> 22:05.780
By the way, what's going on? Who are they?

22:05.780 --> 22:09.060
I remember them saying 
they're Machine Siblings.

22:09.060 --> 22:11.800
Machine Siblings? They're mechas?!

22:11.800 --> 22:14.350
No, the Great Devil Order!

22:14.350 --> 22:15.100
Oh.

22:15.100 --> 22:17.190
You know of them?

22:17.640 --> 22:20.620
It seems the day of the 
final battle is close.

22:21.380 --> 22:26.360
We'll all need to come together 
and face them as one!

22:26.360 --> 22:28.920
Still, I'm surprised you could do that.

22:27.060 --> 22:30.680
Being machine siblings sounds nice.

22:27.060 --> 22:31.650
What? They're not machines?

22:31.650 --> 22:35.830
Listen up! I'm saying something 
really important here!

22:41.850 --> 22:43.310
I'm...

22:45.020 --> 22:47.310
Demioros the Deliverance.

22:47.310 --> 22:51.140
I'll send you to hell!

22:52.260 --> 22:54.220
Die!

22:54.220 --> 22:56.350
Sei-chan!

23:17.500 --> 23:19.660
O-Onii-chan?

23:20.180 --> 23:21.430
Seiichi?

23:22.440 --> 23:23.820
Seiichi?

23:25.370 --> 23:26.580
Sei...

23:28.050 --> 23:33.170
No!

23:35.850 --> 23:37.710
Everyone, this is Hiiragi Seiichi.

23:37.710 --> 23:41.810
It was a short run, but thank you all 
for watching <i>The Fruit of Evolution 2</i>.

23:41.810 --> 23:45.100
I'm kidding! There's no way I'd die like that!

23:45.100 --> 23:46.900
I'm the protagonist!

23:46.900 --> 23:48.690
Next time, "Seiichi Dies."

23:46.900 --> 23:50.250
<b>Next Time
Seiichi Dies</b>
